~C. The courthouse, because buildings cannot have meaning.#This dismisses the setting incorrectly. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~D. The trial, because it has no connection to silence.#The trial and silence are connected. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

