~C. Hope and grief cannot exist together.#The passage states both are present. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
=D. Leaving home can create both opportunity and loss.#Correct. This theme fits both situations. Notice how the answer uses the exact wording, evidence, or concept required by the standard.
}

